[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14522.15, "timestamp": "04:02:02", "text": "先变成蓝色，再变成红色，然后又变成另一种颜色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14525.83, "timestamp": "04:02:05", "text": "我想应该是颜色吧。然后你就会遇到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14529.189, "timestamp": "04:02:09", "text": "我想，到终点了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14533.429, "timestamp": "04:02:13", "text": "我们去了别的地方，然后就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14537.75, "timestamp": "04:02:17", "text": "我把马放在这里。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14540.71, "timestamp": "04:02:20", "text": "男人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14543.269, "timestamp": "04:02:23", "text": "路还很长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14546.63, "timestamp": "04:02:26", "text": "你还在关注吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14550.55, "timestamp": "04:02:30", "text": "所以，蓝色、红色、紫色，那就太棒了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14552.95, "timestamp": "04:02:32", "text": "我猜是吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14555.99, "timestamp": "04:02:35", "text": "这路程真长。等等，在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14557.99, "timestamp": "04:02:37", "text": "你是？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14560.87, "timestamp": "04:02:40", "text": "你遥遥领先。你是怎么走的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14563.83, "timestamp": "04:02:43", "text": "前面？如何加快速度？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14566.63, "timestamp": "04:02:46", "text": "呃，落地，跑，然后，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14570.87, "timestamp": "04:02:50", "text": "按空格键两次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14572.79, "timestamp": "04:02:52", "text": "我在这里。"}]